      "claim": "C4",
      "evidence": "R320 scores 144 policies over 4 datasets / 6 tasks / 34,539 operations / 3,699 positives. Operation-stack query-aware profiling inspects median 9.37% of operations in top-5 groups, versus 100.00% for flat summaries. Against fixed-session query-aware drilldown, operation stacks improve top-5 recall on 5/6 tasks and reduce group fragmentation from median 285.0 to 157.5 groups. R311 remains as the earlier robustness check: flat selectivity 6/6, high-lift 5/6, higher recall than fixed 5/6, and lower work than fixed only 2/6.",
